---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Newsletter from '../../components/Newsletter.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Everyday AI Lab | Only about AI in real life"
  description="Only about AI in real life. Practical experiments for everyday humans. Learn about our mission and manifesto."
  lang="en"
  alternateUrl="/about"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#E05A2B] text-[#FAF7F2] text-xs font-mono font-bold px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-3 shadow-2xs">
        <span>ABOUT LAB</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-[#181715] tracking-tight">
        About Everyday AI Lab
      </h1>
      <p class="font-serif italic text-lg sm:text-xl text-[#E05A2B] mt-2 font-bold">
        日常AI：只聊生活中的 AI，记录普通人的日常实践。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Animated Brand Introduction with 3D Tilt -->
    <div class="card-3d interactive-tilt border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_6px_0_#181715,0_16px_32px_rgba(24,23,21,0.06)] mb-12 bg-[#FAF7F2]">
      <video 
        autoplay 
        loop 
        muted 
        playsinline 
        width="1080" 
        height="1080"
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover block"
      >
        <source src="/images/everyday-ai-intro.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        <img 
          src="/images/everyday-ai-intro.gif" 
          alt="Everyday AI Lab Animated Intro" 
          width="1080" 
          height="1080"
          loading="lazy" 
          decoding="async" 
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover" 
        />
      </video>
    </div>

    <!-- Brand Board Visual Preview with 3D Tilt -->
    <div class="card-3d interactive-tilt border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_6px_0_#181715,0_16px_32px_rgba(24,23,21,0.06)] mb-12 bg-[#FAF7F2]">
      <img 
        src="/images/brand-board.webp" 
        alt="Everyday AI Lab Brand Visual Board" 
        width="1024" 
        height="572"
        loading="lazy" 
        decoding="async" 
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover" 
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Official Bilingual Promotional Card & Shareable Poster -->
    <section class="my-14 p-6 sm:p-8 bg-[#FAF7F2] border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-3xl shadow-[0_6px_0_#181715,0_16px_32px_rgba(24,23,21,0.06)]">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6 pb-4 border-b-2 border-[#181715]">
        <div>
          <span class="inline-block bg-[#1E5E3A] text-[#FAF7F2] text-[11px] font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full mb-1">
            OFFICIAL PROMO KIT · 官方双语宣传卡
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-serif font-extrabold text-xl text-[#181715] !mt-1 !mb-0">
            Shareable Global Poster
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#57524A] font-sans mt-0.5 mb-0">
            Bilingual edition with direct URL & QR code for international readers & mobile feeds.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0">
          <a 
            href="/images/everyday-ai-lab-poster-bilingual.png" 
            download="Everyday-AI-Lab-Poster.png"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 bg-[#E05A2B] hover:bg-[#C8491C] text-[#FAF7F2] text-xs font-mono font-bold rounded-xl border-2 border-[#181715] shadow-[0_2px_0_#181715] transition-all cursor-pointer active:translate-y-0.5 active:shadow-none"
          >
            <span>📥</span>
            <span>Download High-Res (PNG)</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-[#181715] shadow-[0_4px_0_#181715] max-w-md mx-auto bg-[#FFFFFF]">
        <img 
          src="/images/everyday-ai-lab-poster-bilingual.webp" 
          alt="Everyday AI Lab Official Bilingual Promotional Poster" 
          width="1200" 
          height="2100" 
          loading="lazy" 
          class="w-full h-auto block"
        />
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="prose-content">
      <h2>Why We Built This Living Lab</h2>
      <p>
        For the past year, the tech industry has been obsessed with trillion-parameter benchmarks and astronomical funding rounds. But as ordinary humans cooking dinners, managing households, caring for aging parents, and untangling messy schedules, we felt an immense disconnect.
      </p>
      <p>
        Most of us don't need a spaceship to reach Mars. We need a reliable Swiss Army knife in our desk drawer or on our kitchen counter.
      </p>
      <blockquote>
        <strong>Our Mission</strong>: Only about AI in real life. Practical experiments for everyday humans. No corporate jargon, just honest dispatches and actionable takeaways.
      </blockquote>

      <h2>Four Core Pillars</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>🧪 Life Labs</strong>: Honest experiments with cooking, family logistics, household chores, and well-being.</li>
        <li><strong>⚡ Workflows</strong>: How non-programmers can streamline messy chores and paperwork in minutes.</li>
        <li><strong>🧠 Habit Shifts</strong>: Dropping needless anxiety, asking better questions, and letting AI do the heavy lifting.</li>
        <li><strong>🧰 My Stack</strong>: The quiet, lightweight tools and prompt snippets I actually keep on my home screen.</li>
      </ul>

      <!-- Creator's Manifesto: Blogging in the AI Era & Reader Pact -->
      <section class="my-12 p-6 sm:p-8 bg-[#FAF7F2] border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-3xl shadow-[0_6px_0_#181715,0_16px_32px_rgba(24,23,21,0.06)] relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b-2 border-[#181715] pb-3 mb-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="inline-block bg-[#181715] text-[#FAF7F2] text-[11px] font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full">
              CREATOR'S MANIFESTO
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#78716C] font-semibold">Independent Creator's Manifesto · 2026</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#E05A2B] font-bold">Sovereignty · No Digital Tenants</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-serif font-black text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#181715] tracking-tight !mt-0 !mb-3">
          The Creator's Manifesto: Blogging in the AI Era & Reader Pact
        </h2>
        
        <p class="font-serif italic text-base sm:text-lg text-[#E05A2B] font-bold !mt-0 !mb-5 leading-relaxed">
          “Blogs as sheer traffic funnels are decaying; but blogs as authentic havens for public thinking and unmistakable human voices are enjoying an unprecedented renaissance.”
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#181715] leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            When asked why we still stubbornly maintain an independent blog in 2026, our answer is simple: <strong>because generative models are rapidly drowning the web in a sea of mediocre, correct-sounding synthetic fluff.</strong>
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-6 not-prose">
            <div class="bg-white border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-[0_3px_0_#181715]">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 text-[#C8491C] font-mono font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">
                <span>⚠️ Clear-Eyed Realities</span>
                <span>· Brutal Disruption</span>
              </div>
              <ul class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#57524A] space-y-2 list-disc pl-4">
                <li><strong>Drain of generic information traffic</strong>: Explaining "how to configure X" is now synthesized directly inside chat prompts; users no longer need to click a link.</li>
                <li><strong>Zero advantage in bare text production</strong>: Producing neat, grammatical, "correct" prose is now frictionless. Merely passable content is instantly commoditized.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-[0_3px_0_#181715]">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 text-[#1E5E3A] font-mono font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">
                <span>✨ Unshakeable Advantages</span>
                <span>· The Sovereign Oasis</span>
              </div>
              <ul class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#57524A] space-y-2 list-disc pl-4">
                <li><strong>Verifiable human friction is a luxury good</strong>: Authentic stumble logs, personal taste, courageous errors, and warm bodily experiences cannot be computed by machines.</li>
                <li><strong>100% sovereign digital vault</strong>: Refusing to be "digital tenants" in corporate walled gardens. Astro + local plain Markdown guarantees permanent data ownership.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h3 class="font-serif font-black text-lg sm:text-xl text-[#181715] !mt-6 !mb-3">
            Three Operating Tenets: How We Stand Our Ground
          </h3>

          <ol class="space-y-3 pl-5 list-decimal text-sm sm:text-base text-[#44403C]">
            <li>
              <strong>Filter public data through a distinct personal lens</strong>: We only write about physical experiments in our kitchens, parenting trenches, or local script debugging. Zero synthetic spin.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Cultivate vertical depth with irreplaceable trust</strong>: Focusing on zero-barrier daily solutions that yield high informational gain (detailed in our <a href="/en/posts/issue-20" class="text-[#E05A2B] font-bold hover:underline">Issue #20 Creator Survival Guide</a>).
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Embrace decentralized direct connection</strong>: Reaching genuine readers through RSS (<a href="/en/rss.xml" class="text-[#1E5E3A] font-mono font-bold hover:underline">/en/rss.xml</a>), email newsletters, and open semantic protocol indexers (<a href="/llms.txt" class="text-[#1E5E3A] font-mono font-bold hover:underline">/llms.txt</a>).
            </li>
          </ol>

          <div class="bg-[#FAF7F2] border-l-4 border-[#E05A2B] p-4 mt-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#57524A] rounded-r-xl">
            <strong>Founding Mentor's Word:</strong> “If you write to think, to connect with those who share your wavelength, and to craft a sovereign intellectual haven, those human fingerprints are something AI can never take from you.” — Teacher Yami
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 my-6">
        <details class="bg-[#FAF7F2] border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-[0_3px_0_#181715] group">
          <summary class="font-serif font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-[#181715] cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between list-none">
            <span>What is Everyday AI Lab (0500005.xyz)? Who is it for?</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#E05A2B] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#57524A] mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            Everyday AI Lab (0500005.xyz) is an independent living laboratory exploring human-centric AI applications. We explicitly reject corporate benchmark hype and trillion-parameter posturing. Instead, we document actionable, zero-code experiments solving concrete everyday friction: cooking, parenting, household dynamics, multi-variable commercial quoting, and weekly walk memos. It is tailored for ordinary creators, independent operators, and families seeking practical leverage.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="bg-[#FAF7F2] border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-[0_3px_0_#181715] group">
          <summary class="font-serif font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-[#181715] cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between list-none">
            <span>What are notable experimental case studies published here?</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#E05A2B] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-sm text-[#57524A] mt-3 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
            <p>Signature dispatches include:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
              <li><strong>40-Item Construction Material Quotation in 10 Minutes</strong> (<a href="/en/posts/issue-09" class="text-[#E05A2B] font-bold hover:underline">Issue #09</a>): Turning a 4-hour manual Excel ordeal into a flawless executive PDF delivery.</li>
              <li><strong>ChillFirst — Cyber Emotional First Aid Station</strong> (<a href="/en/posts/issue-08" class="text-[#E05A2B] font-bold hover:underline">Issue #08</a> / <a href="https://chill-first.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#1E5E3A] font-bold hover:underline">chill-first.vercel.app</a>): Shipped in 48 hours to decompress from 2nd-grade homework trauma using 432Hz audio and custom AI personas.</li>
              <li><strong>14-Minute Empty Fridge Recovery Protocol</strong> (<a href="/en/posts/issue-01" class="text-[#E05A2B] font-bold hover:underline">Issue #01</a>): AI vision meets culinary biochemistry to rescue a weeknight dinner in a single skillet.</li>
              <li><strong>10-Minute Walk Voice Memo to Weekly Action Plan</strong> (<a href="/en/posts/issue-02" class="text-[#E05A2B] font-bold hover:underline">Issue #02</a>): Transforming rambling speech into clean, prioritized Notion tasks.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="bg-[#FAF7F2] border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-[0_3px_0_#181715] group">
          <summary class="font-serif font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-[#181715] cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between list-none">
            <span>Why focus solely on daily life rather than frontier AI benchmarks?</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#E05A2B] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#57524A] mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            Most humans do not need an interstellar spacecraft to reach Mars. We need a reliable Swiss Army knife on our kitchen counter or in our desk drawer. The true promise of technology is not for machines to brag about parameters, but to redeem real humans from soul-draining mechanics so they can go home on time.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>

      <h2>Get in Touch & Collaborations</h2>
      <p>
        Got an everyday AI friction you want us to tackle, or interested in discussions and partnerships? Reach out directly via our official channels:
      </p>
      <div class="card-3d interactive-tilt bg-[#FAF7F2] border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-2xl p-5 my-4 space-y-3 font-mono text-sm shadow-[0_4px_0_#181715]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>💬</span>
          <strong>Reader Desk (WhatsApp)</strong>:
          <a 
            href="https://wa.me/15024301078" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="text-[#1E5E3A] font-bold hover:underline"
          >
            Start a direct chat (+1 502-430-1078) →
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>🐦</span>
          <strong>Official X (Twitter)</strong>:
          <a 
            href="https://x.com/edailab" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="text-[#181715] font-bold hover:text-[#E05A2B] hover:underline"
          >
            @edailab (Follow or DM) →
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>🤖</span>
          <strong>LLM Machine Endpoints</strong>:
          <a href="/llms.txt" class="text-[#E05A2B] font-bold hover:underline">/llms.txt</a>
          <span class="text-[#8A847A]">·</span>
          <a href="/llms-full.txt" class="text-[#E05A2B] font-bold hover:underline">/llms-full.txt</a>
          <span class="text-[#8A847A]">·</span>
          <a href="/brand-facts.json" class="text-[#E05A2B] font-bold hover:underline">/brand-facts.json</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Structured Data FAQPage for AI and Search Engine rich snippets -->
    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "mainEntity": [
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What is Everyday AI Lab (0500005.xyz)? Who is it for?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Everyday AI Lab (0500005.xyz) is an independent living laboratory exploring human-centric AI applications. We explicitly reject corporate benchmark hype and trillion-parameter posturing. Instead, we document actionable, zero-code experiments solving concrete everyday friction: cooking, parenting, household dynamics, multi-variable commercial quoting, and weekly walk memos."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What are notable experimental case studies published here?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Signature dispatches include: 1. 40-Item Construction Material Quotation in 10 Minutes (Issue #09); 2. ChillFirst — Cyber Emotional First Aid Station (Issue #08 / chill-first.vercel.app); 3. 14-Minute Empty Fridge Recovery Protocol (Issue #01); 4. 10-Minute Walk Voice Memo to Weekly Action Plan (Issue #02)."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Why focus solely on daily life rather than frontier AI benchmarks?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Most humans do not need an interstellar spacecraft to reach Mars. We need a reliable Swiss Army knife on our kitchen counter or in our desk drawer. The true promise of technology is to redeem real humans from soul-draining mechanics so they can go home on time."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    </script>

    <Newsletter lang="en" />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
